</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="aligncenter size-full wp-image-107596" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31389-Iconic-Ferris-Wheel-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1200" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31389-Iconic-Ferris-Wheel-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31389-Iconic-Ferris-Wheel-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31389-Iconic-Ferris-Wheel-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31389-Iconic-Ferris-Wheel-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Creator-3in1-31389-Iconic-Ferris-Wheel-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
