										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://howl.link/zausn3rqsuvg9" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-98089 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75435-Battle-of-Felucia-Separatist-MTT-Summer-August-2025-Set-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="873" height="841" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75435-Battle-of-Felucia-Separatist-MTT-Summer-August-2025-Set-Front-Box.jpg 873w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75435-Battle-of-Felucia-Separatist-MTT-Summer-August-2025-Set-Front-Box-300x289.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75435-Battle-of-Felucia-Separatist-MTT-Summer-August-2025-Set-Front-Box-768x740.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 873px) 100vw, 873px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a> LEGO November 2026 Deals continue. They now have <a href="https://howl.link/zausn3rqsuvg9" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Star Wars: The Clone Wars Battle of Felucia Separatist MTT 75435</a> on sale for<strong> $127.99</strong> (reg.$159.99). Savings work out to be 20% off. Note that this is a sold out set at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO USA</a>. It is also listed as retiring soon on <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO USA</a>. This might be your last final chance to get the MTT at a sale price!</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a></li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/zausn3rqsuvg9" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-98090 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75435-Battle-of-Felucia-Separatist-MTT-Summer-August-2025-Set-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="1108" height="722" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75435-Battle-of-Felucia-Separatist-MTT-Summer-August-2025-Set-Back-Box.jpg 1108w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75435-Battle-of-Felucia-Separatist-MTT-Summer-August-2025-Set-Back-Box-300x195.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75435-Battle-of-Felucia-Separatist-MTT-Summer-August-2025-Set-Back-Box-1024x667.jpg 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/07/LEGO-Star-Wars-75435-Battle-of-Felucia-Separatist-MTT-Summer-August-2025-Set-Back-Box-768x500.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1108px) 100vw, 1108px" /></a></p>
<p>Another great buy would be the <a href="https://howl.link/yopdqcaipk11g" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Toy Story Lotso 43306</a> at 40% off for <strong>$23.99 </strong>(reg.$39.99).</p>
<ul>
<li><strong>Shop Now at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a></li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/yopdqcaipk11g" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-106326 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Toy-Story-43306-Lotso-May-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="852" height="833" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Toy-Story-43306-Lotso-May-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 852w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Toy-Story-43306-Lotso-May-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x293.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Toy-Story-43306-Lotso-May-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x751.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 852px) 100vw, 852px" /></a></p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-106318 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Toy-Story-43306-Lotso-May-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg" alt="" width="704" height="845" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Toy-Story-43306-Lotso-May-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box.jpg 704w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/LEGO-Toy-Story-43306-Lotso-May-2026-Release-Date-Back-Box-250x300.jpg 250w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 704px) 100vw, 704px" /></p>
<p>&nbsp;</p>
<p>Don&#8217;t forget that they have <a href="https://howl.link/zbfvkwihhmou7" target="_blank" rel="noopener">over 190 LEGO items on sale</a> as well so do check out the list. Note that some of the regular prices are lower at <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a> compared to <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO USA</a>.</p>
<p>Free shipping on orders above $35 at <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target.com US</a>.<strong> If you have a Target Circle Card, you&#8217;ll save an extra 5% off as well (on top of discounted prices).</strong></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/zbfvkwihhmou7" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-114796 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Sales-Deals-List-November-15-2026.jpg" alt="" width="608" height="892" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Sales-Deals-List-November-15-2026.jpg 608w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/Target-US-LEGO-Sales-Deals-List-November-15-2026-204x300.jpg 204w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 608px) 100vw, 608px" /></a></p>
<p>Keep it lock to Toys N Bricks and we&#8217;ll update you when we have more LEGO Sales &amp; Deals USA offers!</p>
<p><span style="font-weight: 400;"><strong>Tip:</strong> Bookmark Toysnbricks.com and be sure to subscribe to the <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/" target="_blank" rel="external nofollow noopener" data-cke-saved-href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/email-subscription/">free Toysnbricks newsletter subscription</a>. You’ll get LEGO news, new product updates, sales &amp; deals updates, creations and reviews right in your inbox. Alternatively, you can also <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/rss-feed-lego-updates/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">follow us on our RSS Feeds</a> with your RSS Reader/App to get timely updates. </span></p>
<p>We also have a<strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Sales Page Hub</a></strong> too. The <strong>page is updated regularly</strong> so that you don&#8217;t miss out on any bargains. For more <strong>LEGO Sales Finds submitted by Toys N Bricks forum members</strong>, you can <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">visit our LEGO Sales &amp; Deals forum section</a>. Registration for a forum membership account is<strong> free and fast</strong>.</p>
<p><strong>More LEGO reads at Toys N Bricks:</strong> <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-news/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO News</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/legoland-resources/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGOLAND Resource Guides</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/category/lego-reviews/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO Reviews</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-usa/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">US LEGO Deals</a> | <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/lego-sales-deals-list-canada/" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada LEGO Deals</a></p>
<p><strong>Visit our LEGO Forums:</strong> Where traditional and classic meets our <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/forum" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Legacy LEGO Forums</a>. A library of LEGO resources and for members to ask questions. All articles posted on our main site at Toysnbricks.com are posted in the forums as well. The best part is that there are no ads in our LEGO forums. Registration for a basic forum account is free and fast.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-113380 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg" alt="" width="691" height="552" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo.jpg 999w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-300x240.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/Toysnbricks-Forum-Less-AI-Algorithms-More-Human-Articles-and-Forum-Chats-Ad-Banner-Logo-768x613.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 691px) 100vw, 691px" /></p>
