<p>40914 Retro Jukebox GWP will be free when you spend over $250 USD / $325 CAD / £225 GBP / $410 AUD at LEGO (<a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">USA</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Canada</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">UK</a> | <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Australia</a>) during Insiders Weekend from November 21-22, 2026. You need to be an Insiders Rewards Member to qualify (free to join). This set is branded as limited edition on the box.</p>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="alignnone size-full wp-image-114881 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box.webp" alt="" width="846" height="1200" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box.webp 846w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-212x300.webp 212w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-722x1024.webp 722w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/LEGO-40914-Retro-Jukebox-GWP-Gift-with-Purchase-November-2026-Insiders-Weekend-Promotion-Front-Box-768x1089.webp 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 846px) 100vw, 846px" /></p>
<p>For the most up to date current LEGO promotions, offers and gift with purchase (GWP) being offered, check the official LEGO store promotional pages links below.</p>
<ul>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>US United States</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=36166&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-ca%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Canada</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=24340&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-gb%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>UK United Kingdom</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
<li><a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=46079&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-au%2Fpage%2Flego-offers-promotions" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><strong>Australia</strong> – LEGO Shop at Home Promotional Offers Page</a></li>
</ul>
<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-103542 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg" alt="" width="909" height="459" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings.jpg 909w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-300x151.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Sales-Deals-Logo-Banner-Discount-Savings-768x388.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 909px) 100vw, 909px" /></p>
