<li>20% off &#8211; <a href="https://www.amazon.com/LEGO-Botanicals-Mini-Orchid-Building/dp/B0DJ19VGDD?&amp;linkCode=ll2&amp;tag=tnb06-20&amp;linkId=f203aa810e53aa47f46ea32ea6412faa&amp;language=en_US&amp;gaOptInStatus=true&amp;ref_=as_li_ss_tl" target="_blank" rel="noopener">18+ LEGO Botanicals Mini Orchid 10343</a><strong> $23.95</strong> (reg.$29.99)</li>
</ul>
