<p><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102892 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Editions-43020-FIFA-World-Cup-Official-Trophy-March-2026-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="860" height="848" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Editions-43020-FIFA-World-Cup-Official-Trophy-March-2026-Front-Box.jpg 860w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Editions-43020-FIFA-World-Cup-Official-Trophy-March-2026-Front-Box-300x296.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Editions-43020-FIFA-World-Cup-Official-Trophy-March-2026-Front-Box-768x757.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 860px) 100vw, 860px" /></p>
