					<description><![CDATA[<p><img width="1200" height="1200" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75461-Up-Scaled-Darth-Vader-Minifigure-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" class="attachment-post-thumbnail size-post-thumbnail wp-post-image" alt="LEGO Star Wars 75461 Up-Scaled Darth Vader Minifigure Summer June 2026 Release Date Front Box" decoding="async" loading="lazy" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75461-Up-Scaled-Darth-Vader-Minifigure-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75461-Up-Scaled-Darth-Vader-Minifigure-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75461-Up-Scaled-Darth-Vader-Minifigure-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75461-Up-Scaled-Darth-Vader-Minifigure-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75461-Up-Scaled-Darth-Vader-Minifigure-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1200px) 100vw, 1200px" /></p>
<p>Target US has started some of their LEGO Early Black Friday Deals 2026 with 40% off a few</p>
<p>© Toys N Bricks: 2009-Present. <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com/target-usa-lego-early-black-friday-deals-2026-several-sets-on-sale-at-40-off/">Target USA LEGO Early Black Friday Deals 2026: Several Sets On Sale at 40% off</a> appeared first on <a href="https://www.toysnbricks.com"></a>.</p>
]]></description>
										<content:encoded><![CDATA[<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-107377 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75461-Up-Scaled-Darth-Vader-Minifigure-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="1024" height="1024" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75461-Up-Scaled-Darth-Vader-Minifigure-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75461-Up-Scaled-Darth-Vader-Minifigure-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75461-Up-Scaled-Darth-Vader-Minifigure-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75461-Up-Scaled-Darth-Vader-Minifigure-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/LEGO-Star-Wars-75461-Up-Scaled-Darth-Vader-Minifigure-Summer-June-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a> has started some of their LEGO Early Black Friday Deals 2026 with 40% off a few LEGO sets. Note that some of the regular prices are lower at <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a> compared to <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO USA</a>. Thanks to forum member <em>Marshallmario</em> for alerting us all <a href="https://toysnbricks.com/forum/index.php?/topic/3448-usa-black-friday-lego-deals-sales-2026-various-retailers-merchants/page/2/#findComment-8458" target="_blank" rel="noopener">in our LEGO Forums</a>.</p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class=" wp-image-110645 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72150-Munchlax-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png" alt="" width="900" height="900" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72150-Munchlax-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.png 1200w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72150-Munchlax-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.png 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72150-Munchlax-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72150-Munchlax-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.png 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/07/LEGO-Pokemon-72150-Munchlax-Summer-August-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x768.png 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px" /></a></p>
<p>Some of our picks include the following:</p>
<ul>
<li>43% off &#8211; LEGO Star Wars SMART Play Mos Eisley Cantina 75425 <strong>$45.49</strong> (reg.$79.99) &#8211; <em>Actual regular price is $79.99 at <a href="https://click.linksynergy.com/deeplink?id=R/1WEHEfGiI&amp;mid=13923&amp;murl=https%3A%2F%2Fwww.lego.com%2Fen-us%2Fcategories%2Fnew-sets-and-products" target="_blank" rel="noopener">LEGO USA</a> even though Target has a lower regular price</em></li>
<li>40% off &#8211; LEGO Star Wars Up-Scaled Darth Vader Minifigure 75461 <strong>$59.99</strong> (reg.$99.99)</li>
<li>40% off &#8211; LEGO Pokémon Munchlax Adult Building Set 72150<strong> $41.99</strong> (reg.$69.99)</li>
<li>40% off &#8211; LEGO Editions FIFA World Cup Official Trophy 43020<strong> $119.99</strong> (reg.$199.99)</li>
<li>40% off &#8211; LEGO Architecture London Skyline 21034 <strong>$23.99</strong> (reg.$39.99)</li>
<li><strong>Shop Now at Official Site:</strong> <a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Target US</a></li>
</ul>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-104385 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="858" height="854" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box.jpg 858w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-300x300.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-150x150.jpg 150w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/LEGO-Star-Wars-75425-SMART-Play-Mos-Eisley-Cantina-March-2026-Release-Date-Front-Box-768x764.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 858px) 100vw, 858px" /></a></p>
<p><a href="https://howl.link/vdtrq2gdiozih" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><img loading="lazy" decoding="async" class="size-full wp-image-102892 aligncenter" src="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Editions-43020-FIFA-World-Cup-Official-Trophy-March-2026-Front-Box.jpg" alt="" width="860" height="848" srcset="https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Editions-43020-FIFA-World-Cup-Official-Trophy-March-2026-Front-Box.jpg 860w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Editions-43020-FIFA-World-Cup-Official-Trophy-March-2026-Front-Box-300x296.jpg 300w, https://www.toysnbricks.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/LEGO-Editions-43020-FIFA-World-Cup-Official-Trophy-March-2026-Front-Box-768x757.jpg 768w" sizes="auto, (max-width: 860px) 100vw, 860px" /></a></p>
